    "_metadata": {
     "name": "Cam Ward",
     "description": "During the 2010-11 season, no goaltender played more games than Cam Ward, who appeared in 74 games, winning 37 of them and posting a .923 save percentage. In the 2010 NHL Premiere Series held in Helsinki, Finland, Ward stopped Antti Miettinen's final shootout attempt to give Carolina back-to-back wins over the Minnesota Wild. Ward had a busy night, stopping 41 shots, in addition to his three shootout saves, in the 2-1 Carolina victory. The 2006 Conn Smythe Trophy winner spent all but one of his 14 NHL seasons with the Hurricanes.\r\n\r\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
